<title>POLAND: Bourse suspends Rafako trade.</title>
<headline>Bourse suspends Rafako trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse suspended trade in shares of Rafako SA on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bourse gave no reason for the suspension and a bourse official said more details would be announced later on Friday.</p>
<p>Rafako, scheduled to report its March earnings on Thursday, has so far failed to release its monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
